    {
        "text": "Hui-chieh:"
    },
    {
        "text": "If memory serves me correctly, and I don't trust it to, the old man's name was Ivan Iziaslav."
    },
    {
        "text": "A very common name. And he was the sort of peasant farmer you could find anywhere."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he sacrificed himself. For a whole mess of reasons, he gave his own life..."
    },
    {
        "text": "I think about it every now and then. Am I truly worth people sacrificing their lives?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alina went with me. She was gentle most other times, but would suddenly just come out with venomous tongue-lashings. That made me uncomfortable, to say the least."
    },
    {
        "text": "The plan was proceeding smoothly."
    },
    {
        "text": "In accordance with my own ideas, rapidly, the Infected of this place would surely unite as one."
    },
    {
        "text": "I hoped it would be effective."
    },
    {
        "text": "And I hoped it would be enough for the old man to rest peacefully. Aside from the old lady, no-one else had been closer family to me."
    },
    {
        "text": "February 7th"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
